# AP Inbox Dashboard — environment variables (all optional)
#
# Three-tier Claude fallback (tried in order):
#   1. ANTHROPIC_API_KEY set  →  Anthropic API directly (costs tokens)
#   2. OTHER_MODEL_API_KEY set  →  any OpenAI-compatible endpoint (OpenAI, Azure,
#      Gemini, OpenRouter, Ollama, LM Studio …)
#   3. Neither set  →  Claude CLI subprocess (free if `claude` is installed and
#      logged in — run `claude` once in a terminal to authenticate)
#
# Copy this file to .env and uncomment the lines you need.

# --- Tier 1: Anthropic API ---
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# --- Tier 2: OpenAI-compatible provider ---
# OTHER_MODEL_API_KEY=sk-...
# OTHER_MODEL_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1   # default shown; change for Azure / Ollama / etc.
# OTHER_MODEL_NAME=gpt-4o-mini                      # default shown
